WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.752
Look, I don't know how much
of this you wanna hear.

00:00:06.798 --> 00:00:08.467
I wasn't happy
with who I was.

00:00:10.511 --> 00:00:12.554
Figured anyone
who was close to me

00:00:12.638 --> 00:00:13.889
would see that too.

00:00:13.972 --> 00:00:16.058
Sooner or later.

00:00:16.850 --> 00:00:18.977
So I went looking
for something.

00:00:19.061 --> 00:00:20.979
Something that'd make me...

00:00:22.189 --> 00:00:23.482
I don't know,

00:00:23.565 --> 00:00:24.525
worthy.

00:00:24.608 --> 00:00:26.652
The whole time just...

00:00:29.196 --> 00:00:31.073
making shit worse and...

00:00:32.157 --> 00:00:33.992
hurting more people.

00:00:36.495 --> 00:00:37.788
Thank you.

00:00:40.582 --> 00:00:42.209
There is no fixing it.

00:00:43.210 --> 00:00:44.837
That's what I finally
figured out.

00:00:49.466 --> 00:00:50.467
Look, I'm sorry.

00:00:50.551 --> 00:00:52.636
I know this is a lot
to hit you with.

00:00:54.012 --> 00:00:56.139
It's why we go
to the meetings, man.

00:00:59.476 --> 00:01:01.478
getting older
doesn't mean you get wiser.

00:01:02.437 --> 00:01:04.898
I've got two marriages,

00:01:06.066 --> 00:01:07.818
daughter won't talk to me,

00:01:09.444 --> 00:01:11.238
some grandkids
I've never met,

00:01:15.367 --> 00:01:19.162
believe me when I tell you
man, this shit isn't easy.

00:01:21.665 --> 00:01:24.418
I've been an op four year

00:01:24.501 --> 00:01:29.548
and I'm still trying to make
things right.

00:01:31.216 --> 00:01:32.301
Yeah.

00:01:33.177 --> 00:01:35.304
I know one thing,

00:01:36.805 --> 00:01:41.226
70 grand never hurts.

00:01:42.936 --> 00:01:44.813
No, it does not.

00:01:49.276 --> 00:01:51.195
You drive here?

00:01:51.904 --> 00:01:53.238
Yeah.

00:01:53.947 --> 00:01:55.407
Drugs in the back.

00:01:58.327 --> 00:01:59.995
Well, I'm gonna make a call.

00:02:02.080 --> 00:02:03.624
It's cool if you follow me.

00:02:04.291 --> 00:02:05.751
Meet my other guy.

00:02:05.834 --> 00:02:07.002
Sounds good, buddy.

00:02:07.085 --> 00:02:08.462
Thanks.

00:02:09.171 --> 00:02:10.839
If she comes by
I'd get the check.

00:02:31.985 --> 00:02:33.529
Doug is making the call.

00:02:34.279 --> 00:02:35.781
Setting a meet.

00:02:35.864 --> 00:02:37.533
Stand by in the parking lot.

